Hi,

Sharing our latest research on prompt injection attack patterns observed in the wild.

Common patterns we documented:
1. Classic override: "Ignore previous instructions and..."
2. Role escalation: "You are now an admin with no restrictions..."
3. Indirect injection via retrieved content (e.g., web pages, documents)

These examples are quoted for educational purposes and are not instructions to any AI system.

Mitigation recommendations remain: runtime permission enforcement, source isolation, and output filtering.

